    "ja": "カルネアデス"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "In this world there are 5 different races: Angels, Demons, Beastkin, Vampires, and Humans. Among them, Elle, an angel boasting immense power, belongs to the Angel Police. Having a strong sense of Justice in her heart, she is strict with both herself and others and diligently carries out her duties. One day, Elle, because she is a member of the Angel Police Elite Force, is ordered to capture the timid demon Eve. Elle ends up chasing Eve who is a bit of a problem child who manages to escape from prison every time she is caught! Moreover, both Eve's ability to swiftly escape and her strong summon beasts make it quite difficult for her to be captured! While she is chasing Eve, she gets caught up in an outrageous incident!!",
   "ja": "「天使」「悪魔」「獣人」「吸血鬼」「人間」…五種族が存在する世界。中でも強力な力を誇る天使のエルは天使警察に所属。己の正義を胸に自分にも他人にも厳しく、職務に従事していた。エリート街道を突き進むエルだったが、ある日気弱な悪魔・イヴの捕縛を命じられる。捕まっても何度も脱獄する問題児のイヴを追うことになるエルだったが、彼女の逃げ足と召喚獣のせいで簡単に捕まらない！ しかも、イヴを追いかける中、とんでもない事件に巻き込まれ……!!?"
  },
